  "priorExpiration": "2008-03-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4303.02 Fee Due at Importation. Import fees shall be payable to the bureau by the licensee, for each gallon of oil intended for distribution, sale or use that crosses any state geographic border. If a product is imported by ship or barge, the connection at the flange shall be deemed the state line.\n\nSource. #5792, eff 2-24-94; ss by #7199, INTERIM, eff 2-24-00, EXPIRES: 6-23-00; ss and moved by #7219, eff 3-29-00 (formerly Saf-C 4302.02), EXPIRED: 3-29-08\n\nNew. #9376, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10026, eff 11-16-11; ss by #13037, eff 4-20-20",
